# Cred vault sync maintenance (mandatory)

Local and cloud agents must keep the **cred vault** and downstream targets (GitHub Actions secrets, Cloudflare Pages secrets, wrangler bindings) in sync after any vault write or secret rotation.

**Read/write policy:** [`.cursor/rules/cred-vault.mdc`](cred-vault.mdc) — never hardcode, commit, or paste secrets.

**Onboarding:** [AGENT_INIT.md](../AGENT_INIT.md) · [LOCAL-AGENT.md](../LOCAL-AGENT.md) · [CLOUD-AGENT.md](../CLOUD-AGENT.md)

---

## When to run

Run applicable sync scripts **after**:

- Any vault write (`cred set`, GPG encrypt, or manual edit of `credentials.json.gpg`)
- Secret rotation (Cloudflare, GitHub, Resend, Discord, mail tokens, cron, testmail)
- A session that reads or updates tokens for deploy, mail, CI, or Mission Control integrations

### Load vault first

| Environment | Load method |
|-------------|-------------|
| **Local** | `cred get cursor <key>` · GPG store at `/mnt/NewVolume/Personal_Projects/cred/credentials.json.gpg` · passphrase from `.cred-vault-passphrase` or `CRED_VAULT_PASSPHRASE` |
| **Cloud** | `eval "$(node website/admin/scripts/load-cred-vault-env-ci.mjs)"` when `CRED_VAULT_PASSPHRASE` + `CRED_STORE_GPG_BASE64` are set (Cursor Secrets or CI) |
| **Cloud without vault** | Ask maintainer to run sync locally **or** configure cloud secrets + `load-cred-vault-env-ci.mjs` — do not skip sync silently |

---

## Sync scripts (run applicable ones)

Scripts load from vault first, then push to the target. Run only those that match keys you changed.

| Script | Target |
|--------|--------|
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-cred-vault-github.mjs` | CI blob + GitHub `admin-production` secrets — **ALWAYS** after vault changes affecting CI |
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-cloudflare-cred-vault.mjs` | Cloudflare Pages / Workers secrets |
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-mail-cred-vault.mjs` | Outbound mail (Cloudflare Email + routing) |
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-github-token-cred-vault.mjs` | GitHub token used by automation |
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-resend-cred-vault.mjs` | Resend API + From address |
| `node website/admin/scripts/sync-stats-cron-cred-vault.mjs` | Stats cron worker secret |
| `node scripts/sync-discord-cred-vault.mjs` | Discord webhooks (if present) |

Optional: `node website/admin/scripts/sync-testmail-cred-vault.mjs` when testmail keys change.

---

## Never commit

- Decrypted vault JSON, passphrases, or secret values
- `CRED_STORE_GPG_BASE64` blobs in tracked files (sync script pushes to GitHub env only)
- Procedure progress and doc updates **are** OK — no secret values in them

---

## Git push workflow on `main` (cred-vault maintenance ONLY)

Applies **only** when the session is cred-vault sync maintenance — **no feature code** in the same commit.

1. **Prefer amend** — If HEAD in this session was cred-sync-only (procedure/doc notes, no product code):
   ```bash
   git add -A
   git commit --amend --no-edit
   git push origin main
   ```

2. **Non-fast-forward on main** — If push is rejected and the user/agent is doing cred-vault sync maintenance in this session:
   ```bash
   git push --force-with-lease origin main
   ```

3. **Never** force-push `main` for feature work — use PRs or `npm run push:main -- --title "…"` for hotfixes.

4. **Never** force-push if the user did not request vault maintenance in this session.

5. **Rule / doc changes** (like this file) — normal branch + PR; do **not** force-push `main` for governance commits.

---

## Verification (mask-only)

After sync:

- `cred get cursor <key>` — confirm masked preview only (e.g. `4eddb***`)
- `gh secret list` — confirm expected secret names exist; do not print values
- No echo of tokens, passphrases, or webhook URLs in terminal output, chat, or PR body

---

## Agent checklist

1. Write secret to vault (local GPG or cloud load + export path)
2. Run matching `sync-*-cred-vault.mjs` scripts (GitHub sync if CI affected)
3. Mask-only verification
4. Update procedure **Progress** if tracked work — no secret values
5. Push per workflow above (maintenance-only amend/force-with-lease **or** PR for rule/docs)
